  "content": "<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>#&nbsp;<img src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/26a0_fe0f/32.png\" alt=\"⚠️\">&nbsp;重要提醒\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>此模組需要 **Fabric API** 才能運作。</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/27a1_fe0f/32.png\" alt=\"➡️\">&nbsp;若無安裝 Fabric API，遊戲/伺服器將無法啟動。</div>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>下載位置：&nbsp;<img><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/&lt;wbr&gt;minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api</a></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>Tab &amp; Locator Color 是一款輕量級的 Fabric 伺服器端模組，讓玩家可以自訂自己的 Tab 列表顏色與定位點顏色，並支援完整同步。\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/2728/32.png\" alt=\"✨\">&nbsp;功能特色</div>\n<div>- 使用指令或圖形介面變更玩家顏色</div>\n<div>- Tab 列表顏色與定位點顏色始終保持同步</div>\n<div>- 直觀的圖形介面，提供基本顏色與深淺選擇</div>\n<div>- 自動分配顏色：</div>\n<div>&nbsp; - 前 16 位玩家獲得獨特顏色（無重複）</div>\n<div>&nbsp; - 後續玩家則獲得智慧生成、高辨識度的顏色</div>\n<div>- 介面簡潔，工具提示不雜亂</div>\n<div>- 支援多國語言（10 種語言）</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/1f3ae/32.png\" alt=\"🎮\">&nbsp;指令</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>/locatorcolor gui&nbsp;&nbsp;</div>\n<div>→ 開啟顏色選擇圖形介面</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>/locatorcolor set &lt;顏色&gt;&nbsp;&nbsp;</div>\n<div>→ 使用預定義顏色名稱設定顏色（例如 red、blue）</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>/locatorcolor set #RRGGBB&nbsp;&nbsp;</div>\n<div>→ 使用 HEX 色碼設定顏色</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>/locatorcolor reset&nbsp;&nbsp;</div>\n<div>→ 重設顏色為自動分配</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/1f3a8/32.png\" alt=\"🎨\">&nbsp;圖形介面</div>\n<div>- 16 種基本顏色</div>\n<div>- 每種顏色 45 種深淺變化</div>\n<div>- 一鍵選取</div>\n<div>- 即時套用至 Tab 列表與定位點</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/1f465/32.png\" alt=\"👥\">&nbsp;基於玩家的顏色系統</div>\n<div>不同於傳統的計分板隊伍顏色系統，此模組允許每位玩家自由選擇自己的顏色。</div>\n<div>- 無需伺服器管理隊伍</div>\n<div>- 玩家可透過選擇相同顏色來視覺分組</div>\n<div>- 實現靈活且動態的隊伍組織</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/1f30d/32.png\" alt=\"🌍\">&nbsp;支援語言</div>\n<div>- 英文 (en_us)</div>\n<div>- 日文 (ja_jp)</div>\n<div>- 德文 (de_de)</div>\n<div>- 法文 (fr_fr)</div>\n<div>- 西班牙文 (es_es)</div>\n<div>- 葡萄牙文 (pt_br)</div>\n<div>- 義大利文 (it_it)</div>\n<div>- 韓文 (ko_kr)</div>\n<div>- 簡體中文 (zh_cn)</div>\n<div>- 俄文 (ru_ru)</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/1f4a1/32.png\" alt=\"💡\">&nbsp;備註</div>\n<div>- 僅需安裝於伺服器端（客戶端無需安裝任何東西）</div>\n<div>- 適用於 Fabric 1.21.11~26.2 版本</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>非常適合想要提升玩家視覺辨識度、自訂化與靈活隊伍分組的多人生存伺服器！</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
